Rāma marvels and asks lifeless forest cause --- Agastya begins tale in Kr̥ta age --- Manu bids Ikṣvāku found lines and punish justly --- Manu departs joyful to Brahmalōka --- Ikṣvāku begets hundred godlike sons --- Youngest Daṇḍa proves dull and disobedient --- Father grants Daṇḍa realm between Vindhya and Śaivala --- Daṇḍa founds Madhumanta with Uśanas priest